WEBVTT

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.140
<i>I'm sinking.</i>

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:15.130
<i>Deeper and deeper.</i>

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.560
You're a wonderful singer, Teika-kun.

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:28.830
The Ichijoji family has been a distinguished 
family of singers since the Heian Era.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:32.800
That tradition was interrupted by the 
Meiji Restoration, but is now returning to life.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:39.020
You must devote yourself to singing 
for the sake of the Ichijoji family.

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:40.810
We expect great things from you, Teika.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.060
Okay.

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:44.680
<i>I love singing.</i>

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:49.070
<i>Why can't I breathe?</i>

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:55.880
<i>Why?</i>

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.020
<i>Why?</i>

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:30.140
<b>Magic-Kyun Renaissance!</b>

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:45.010
The Light Out of Reach

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:48.520
<i>There are only two more weeks 
until the Hoshi Festival.</i>

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:55.860
<i>It's summer. Summer is here!</i>

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:58.080
Good work, guys.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:59.180
Good work.

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:00.260
Good work.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:02.020
It's so hot.

00:03:02.020 --> 00:03:04.960
The air conditioning inside 
the tent wasn't running yet.

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:06.340
It'll only get hotter.

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:08.040
We just started wearing our summer uniforms.

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:11.920
Anyway, people around school 
are starting to get excited.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:14.460
Everyone loves the stars you made, Rin Rin.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:16.000
Thanks.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:19.020
I don't mind when the atmosphere 
around school is like that.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:22.570
It feels like the festival 
is finally starting.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:25.380
Things are going better than expected.

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:27.930
Everyone in my classes is excited, too.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:30.680
We worked really hard.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:31.760
Yeah.

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:34.190
Why is that in the past tense?

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:37.910
The most important time is now.

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:39.190
You've let yourselves relax too much.

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:41.450
S-Sorry.

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:46.880
Because Tatewaki-senpai changed 
majors from sculpting to baking,

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:49.080
the Art Session has changed as well.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:52.580
This is no time to be celebrating.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:57.790
You're always so harsh, Georgie.

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:59.010
It's okay.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:00.990
We'll just have to keep 
working until the festival.

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:04.340
You're right. Shall we practice again today?

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:09.050
Yeah. We've received permission to 
check out the special event tent.

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:10.330
Let's go take a look.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:11.350
Okay.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:15.350
Teika.

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:18.480
Are you getting enough sleep?

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:20.810
What are you talking about?

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:23.270
You're never around in the morning.

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:26.050
We have the Hoshi Festival coming up.

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:27.490
It can't be helped for now.

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:29.990
Okay.

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:33.500
This is the special event tent?

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:36.710
It really feels like the day 
of the event is approaching.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.250
I'm on fire now!

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:42.610
We'll start by checking our 
positioning during the Art Session.

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:43.790
Okay.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:47.010
Aigasaki.

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:48.260
Let's go.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:51.770
Okay.

00:04:55.410 --> 00:04:59.670
It really is something else when you 
bring seven artists' lights together.

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:01.910
Are our hearts one now?

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:03.310
I can't say they aren't.

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:06.930
We have the bamboo shoot 
squats to thank for that.

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:08.050
Bamboo shoots?

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:10.210
It's a long story.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:13.440
All your sparkles are shining so brightly.

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:16.530
Let's keep this up until 
the actual performance.

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:18.850
It's okay. I know we can do it.

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:29.050
<b>3 Days Until the Hoshi Festival!</b>

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:30.740
One, two, three.

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:32.240
One, two, three.

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:33.600
One, two, three.

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:35.180
One, two, three.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.520
That's it. You're looking good.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:40.020
Nice. Keep going.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:45.230
That was perfect, my little flower.

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:46.590
Good job.

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:48.030
Thank you.

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:51.280
Now I'm all set for the dance party.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:55.090
My little flower,

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:57.940
will you be my partner for the last dance?

00:05:57.940 --> 00:05:58.500
What?

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:04.000
I want to dance with you.

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:06.510
Uh, um...

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:09.040
Angelo, you've already 
danced with her plenty.

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:10.690
Haven't you had enough?

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:11.510
Rin Rin.

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:16.560
Aigasaki, dance with me 
during the last dance.

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.140
Be my partner.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:18.840
What?

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:21.230
Hey, Rin Rin. Don't butt in.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:23.170
Well, you had a false start, Angelo.

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:25.010
It should be a fair decision.

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:26.400
Senpai.

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.500
Will you dance the last dance with me?

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:29.350
What?

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:30.500
I'm sure we'll have fun.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:31.920
Kanato-kun, you too?

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:33.410
No way, Hibiki.

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:36.990
Hana-chan-senpai's dancing with me.

00:06:38.110 --> 00:06:39.380
Right, Senpai?

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:40.260
Hana-chan?

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:41.780
Wait a minute, Tsukushi.

00:06:41.780 --> 00:06:43.290
You don't mind, do you?

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:46.810
Hey, you two are first-years.

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:48.700
You can dance with her next year.

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:49.360
Yeah.

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:52.050
You're not ready for a last dance.

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.450
Don't underestimate us.

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:56.810
The last dance is important to us, too.

00:06:57.230 --> 00:07:00.410
This is our last high school dance.

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:02.550
Is it <i>really?</i>

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:04.370
Maybe you'll still be here next year.

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:05.370
Hey!

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:06.820
Then it should be me.

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:09.170
But this year only comes once.

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:10.820
Everyone only has one chance.

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:12.180
In any case,

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:14.900
I'm going to be dancing the last 
dance with my little flower.

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:15.760
No, me.

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:16.320
Me!

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:17.490
It's me.

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:20.330
What are you all shouting about?

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:23.580
Aoi-kun. Um, the last dance...

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:27.090
Aigasaki-san, will you dance with me?

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:28.590
What?!

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:31.660
Seriously? There's more?

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:33.590
All right. How should we settle this?

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:36.730
I don't care who challenges me.

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:38.270
It's going to be me no matter what.

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:39.280
I don't think so.

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:42.100
But if we make things any more confusing,

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:44.550
I think Senpai will lose her mind.

00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:47.610
Why? Why? Why?

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.530
We don't have a choice.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.360
We'll have to call a truce for now.

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:54.030
No stealing a march on the others.

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:58.160
By the way, where's Georgie-senpai?

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:00.420
He's probably training by himself.

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:01.360
Training?

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:02.660
What? You don't know?

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:05.170
He goes running all the time.

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:09.140
He still practices when he's already so good?

00:08:09.140 --> 00:08:12.230
He's perfecting perfection.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:14.050
That's why he's the king.

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:17.340
He's always been stoic,

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:19.600
but lately he's been even more so.

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:22.560
Sometimes I think he overdoes it.

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:31.710
The Hoshi Festival snuck up on us, didn't it?

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:32.570
Yeah.

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:36.820
I'm really excited for your Art Session.

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.790
Juri-chan, you're running a theater cafe?

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:40.510
Yeah, that's right.

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:41.760
What's it like?

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:43.940
You'll find out when you come.

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:45.000
I'll definitely be there!

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:54.850
<i>Ichijoji-kun.</i>

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:58.970
<i>I hope he's okay.</i>

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:05.600
Now that's unusual.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:08.560
I've never seen the king 
wipe sweat from his brow.

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:10.750
Ichijoji-kun has been the most dedicated

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:13.490
to practicing for the Art 
Session out of all of us.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:17.410
Really? I guess he has just 
that much riding on it.

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:27.000
<i>I wonder why Ichijoji-kun seems 
to be in so much pain sometimes.</i>

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:32.250
<i>One more day until the Hoshi Festival.</i>

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:08.420
It's been a while, 
Masana-niisan, Shinra-niisan.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:09.760
Yeah.

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:12.170
You've gotten taller, Teika-kun.

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:17.050
Hey, it's the Ichijoji brothers.

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:18.720
They're super rare.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.930
Those are Ichijoji-kun's brothers?

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:21.910
Yeah.

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:25.780
The two of them are really 
important trustees of the school.

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:27.180
His brothers are?

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:37.940
It's finally tomorrow, Teika-kun.

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:40.090
Yes, Shinra-niisan.

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:42.400
How is the Art Session coming along?

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:44.140
Do you think it'll go well?

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:44.950
Of course.

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:50.710
The Aigasaki girl won't 
outshine you, will she?

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:52.960
Vice Chairwoman
Aigasaki Kohana

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:52.960
Of course not.

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:59.560
Teika-kun, you're to be Ichijoji Entertainment's
 first foray into global markets.

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:05.210
The special training you've been 
receiving has been to that end.

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:11.480
Succeeding at the Art Session will 
lead you to the Artista Prince title.

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:15.100
You may be confident,

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:17.030
but you mustn't let your guard down.

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:20.240
Don't disappoint us.

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:23.740
I know.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:30.740
Teika.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:38.260
Did your brothers say something to you again?

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.660
That's none of your business.

00:11:42.190 --> 00:11:44.440
Sometimes you seem like 
you can hardly breathe.

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:47.570
You've always been that way,

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:54.180
but since Tatewaki-senpai 
nearly dropped out...

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:56.950
As a member of the Ichijoji family,

00:11:56.950 --> 00:11:59.020
I have devoted my entire being to singing.

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:01.530
There's nothing difficult 
or painful about it.

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:12.890
After meeting Aigasaki-san, I changed.

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:15.170
Teika, so have you.

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:17.340
Aigasaki has nothing to do with this.

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:19.970
I simply sing my songs.

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:22.840
Teika.

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:29.280
You don't understand.

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:03.260
Her light is so clear and warm.

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:07.520
I could never produce a light like this.

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:22.680
After meeting Aigasaki-san, I changed.

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:25.030
Teika, so have you.

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:34.660
Don't disappoint us.

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.430
Magic-Kyun for you.

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:54.400
Magic-Kyun.

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:56.090
Renaissance.

00:13:58.250 --> 00:13:59.980
It's done.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:03.480
We've finished making all the 
preparations for the Hoshi Festival.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:05.500
I'm so excited for tomorrow.

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:07.680
It's almost here.

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:10.720
Let's celebrate.

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:12.240
Yeah!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.240
For tomorrow.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:17.000
Cheers!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.090
It's so good.

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:21.940
Kanato-kun, thank you so much.

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:22.780
That's good.

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:25.260
It was a lot of work, but it's nearly time.

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:26.410
Yeah.

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:28.760
Ten more hours?

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:30.760
I'm so nervous.

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:33.260
It went by so quickly.

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:36.020
You too, Rin?

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:40.240
I'm so excited, I don't think I can sleep.

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:42.560
Should we dance all night, then?

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.120
Let's dance.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:52.530
I'm really glad we'll be doing 
the Art Session together.

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:54.340
Aigasaki-senpai?

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:56.040
Where did that come from?

00:14:56.690 --> 00:14:58.810
When I first came to this school,

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:04.380
I saw a few especially wonderful sparkles 
that stood out from all the others.

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:08.420
They belonged to you guys.

00:15:20.590 --> 00:15:22.640
I didn't know that.

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:24.610
Does that mean we actually met then?

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:30.360
So I was surprised when I learned the 
seven of us were on the committee.

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.800
Maybe it's fate.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:33.620
Yeah.

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:40.480
I can't believe the wonderful sparkles 
I saw back then are being brought together.

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:43.910
Or that mine are going to be part of that.

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:45.880
Just thinking about it excites me.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:48.580
Sparkles, huh?

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:52.130
My little flower, you're 
a sommelier of sparkles.

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:55.510
What? A sommelier of sparkles?

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:57.620
Oh, I know what you mean.

00:15:57.990 --> 00:16:01.600
Senpai, you're better than others at 
identifying and assessing the Light of Arte.

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:04.150
Yeah.

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:06.590
It's like you're particularly 
sensitive to them

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:08.650
or have a special sense for them.

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:11.810
The power to see a person's strengths.

00:16:11.810 --> 00:16:12.650
Huh?

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:13.640
Yeah.

00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:17.410
You even see things we don't 
realize about ourselves.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:18.840
What? Um...

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:21.100
We appreciate what you've done for us.

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:25.290
What? But I...

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:32.880
We made it this far because of you 
and Ichijoji-senpai, of course.

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:37.390
I think we have Ichijoji-kun 
to thank for our success, too.

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:39.440
You're right.

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:43.390
Teika's strictness brought us together.

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:47.020
You could be a little 
annoying sometimes, though.

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:49.080
Georgie-senpai, thank you.

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:52.150
Yeah. Thanks, Ichijoji.

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:57.660
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:01.410
Everything I've done was for my own success.

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.160
I thought you'd say that, Ichijoji-senpai.

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:06.920
You're not very honest, are you?

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:09.000
He's always like that.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:11.420
Hey, you're right.

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:14.250
He is who he is.

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:16.180
You should try being honest sometimes.

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:16.930
I know.

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:21.900
The all-important Art Session is tomorrow.

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:23.860
Don't let your guard down.

00:17:23.860 --> 00:17:25.160
Okay.

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:26.810
See you tomorrow.

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:30.900
Good night.

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:32.690
Good work today.

00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:45.950
<i>What's wrong with Ichijoji-kun? Is he okay?</i>

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:57.720
<i>Where did he go?</i>

00:18:01.340 --> 00:18:02.770
Ichijoji-kun?

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:18.390
<i>Wrapped in warmth, my songs freeze</i>

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:23.950
<i>And ring throughout the empty space</i>

00:18:29.260 --> 00:18:30.540
They're beautiful.

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:34.460
But what's wrong with these sparkles?

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:37.050
They're so sad.

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:47.480
<i>Like sinking into a bottomless lake</i>

00:18:47.740 --> 00:18:52.340
<i>I've forgotten how to breathe</i>

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:57.860
<i>The more I struggle, 
the harder it is to breathe</i>

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:54.900
Why?

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:02.030
<i>Why can't I escape?</i>

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:07.370
<i>When I move forward, I become even more lost</i>

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:16.050
<i>I'm sucked further into a deep dark forest</i>

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:17.710
Ichijoji-kun.

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:23.600
<i>How much farther do I have 
to follow this endless path</i>

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:28.130
<i>Before I meet the light known as you?</i>

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:33.980
<i>No matter where I am or what I'm thinking</i>

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:39.240
<i>I simply have to face tomorrow</i>

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:51.870
Teika-kun!

00:20:16.180 --> 00:20:18.650
Why are you crying?

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:23.660
Your sparkles were so sad.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.120
That's the third time

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.410
you've shown up while I've been practicing.

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:33.160
Practicing?

00:20:34.860 --> 00:20:37.420
I practice far more than anyone else.

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:41.460
Everyone expects me to be a prodigy.

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:45.180
That's why I don't let anyone 
see me working so hard.

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:47.720
Are you okay?

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:49.060
What do you mean?

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:52.900
Are you sure you're not 
pushing yourself too hard?

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:54.940
I'm worried about you.

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:57.940
You don't need to worry about me.

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:02.320
Then, why are your sparkles so sad?

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:08.320
I will meet my brothers' expectations.

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:09.940
I will become the Artista Prince

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:12.340
and improve the Ichijoji family name.

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:14.580
That's why I sing.

00:21:15.490 --> 00:21:17.630
I don't have a shred of doubt.

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:20.090
I couldn't possibly be in pain.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:29.600
So you don't have to worry.

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:35.570
You should stay as you are, in the light.

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:36.850
Um, I...

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:49.740
I... I...

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:54.330
I love your singing, Ichijoji-kun!

00:23:25.990 --> 00:23:29.090
Even if you have depressing 
nights or difficult mornings,

00:23:29.550 --> 00:23:31.460
as long as we work together,

00:23:31.460 --> 00:23:33.680
there's nothing we can't overcome.

00:23:33.680 --> 00:23:36.260
Next time on Magic-Kyun! Renaissance:

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>The Festival of Miracles and Magic</b>

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:38.550
"The Festival of Miracles and Magic."

00:23:38.550 --> 00:23:39.980
I know we can do it!
